OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATrio jailed after killing man in
OL,4,A'brutal assault'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShannon Doocey, 32, of Mill Street,
OL,7,Fwill serve a minimum of 20 years after
OL,8,Fjoining the assault, kicking Fowler and
OL,9,Fattacking him with a broken wine
OL,10,Fbottle. A third attacker, Martin
OL,11,FDoocey, 55, of Waverley Court, was
OL,12,Fjailed for 13 years for manslaughter
OL,13,Fafter punching him 14 times in the head
OL,14,Fwhile he was on the floor.
OL,16,FPassing sentence at Lincoln Crown Court
OL,17,Fearlier, Judge James House KC said it
OL,18,Fwas a "brutal assault".
